# Awesome DESIGN.md catalog

Read `.cursor/skills/awesome-design-md/SKILL.md` for workflow.

- Browse slugs: `vendor/awesome-design-md/CATALOG.md`
- Load **one** reference: `vendor/awesome-design-md/design-md/<slug>/DESIGN.md`

Project-root `DESIGN.md` (if present) overrides catalog defaults unless the user asks to adopt a catalog entry.

Pair with Impeccable for execution quality and Oxfords for finished states; do not load all 84 files.
